---
description: Unit and E2E testing conventions
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx},e2e/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Unit/component: Vitest + Testing Library; mock `fetch`; assert behavior, not internals.
- E2E: Playwright under `e2e/`. Grow incremental smokes after each feature; keep the largest suite for the end.
- E2E that hit the real API require the Chat API running locally.
- Prefer accessible queries (`getByRole`, `getByLabelText`) over CSS selectors.
- After fixing review findings, re-run the relevant unit and E2E smokes before marking the slice done.
